WEBVTT

00:00:13.310 --> 00:00:17.590
I know this cold voice

00:00:17.590 --> 00:00:22.020
Taking my friend

00:00:22.020 --> 00:00:26.800
Maybe a little afraid you'll run away

00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:29.700
But right now...

00:00:30.690 --> 00:00:34.720
For this moment in time, I want to hold you tight

00:00:35.250 --> 00:00:39.580
By your side, I'm dreaming of the days

00:00:39.580 --> 00:00:44.060
When I finally look up at the promised sky

00:00:44.330 --> 00:00:48.470
I'll take off and break all the way

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:53.420
For this moment in time, I just wanna be with you

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:57.940
By your side, I'm dreaming of the days

00:00:58.180 --> 00:01:02.250
When I finally look up at the promised sky

00:01:02.770 --> 00:01:06.750
I know I can change all the way

00:01:07.270 --> 00:01:11.830
For the moment...

00:01:11.830 --> 00:01:21.320
I just wanna hold you...

00:01:21.320 --> 00:01:26.100
Hanasakeru Seishonen

00:01:31.470 --> 00:01:33.920
Take the king out of power!

00:01:36.780 --> 00:01:39.210
Apologize to the citizens!

00:01:45.910 --> 00:01:48.010
We were able to escape because of the demonstration.

00:01:48.800 --> 00:01:54.000
It's become quite the spectacle. 
 I didn't know there was this much dissatisfaction among the people.

00:01:54.780 --> 00:01:58.840
- I won't be surprised if they order the military to come in anytime now. - Military?!

00:01:59.470 --> 00:02:03.810
There was an accident that occurred with the helicopter carrying senior officials of the secret police a moment ago.

00:02:04.200 --> 00:02:09.060
- I think they have other things to worry about. 
- It's rumored that it was a planned explosion.

00:02:09.310 --> 00:02:13.020
- Planned explosion? 
- I'll explain more at the hideout.

00:02:14.170 --> 00:02:18.910
Seeds of Disaster

00:02:27.560 --> 00:02:32.260
Your father was supposed to be the king of Raginei.

00:02:33.610 --> 00:02:36.530
I can't realize it, because it came so suddenly.

00:02:41.630 --> 00:02:43.040
Kajika, I'm coming in.

00:02:44.740 --> 00:02:48.470
- Lee-Leng. 
- What's wrong? Can't sleep?

00:02:51.190 --> 00:02:52.780
There's a lot of things going on.

00:02:55.780 --> 00:03:00.090
- Hey, Lee-Leng. - What?
- How long have you known about it for?

00:03:01.390 --> 00:03:04.970
It's been about a year.
 Since the coronation.

00:03:05.410 --> 00:03:08.760
Harry told me. 
 I had a feeling about this...

00:03:09.270 --> 00:03:13.560
...but I was always doubtful so I asked him.

00:03:14.100 --> 00:03:17.090
But, secrets have a way of getting out.

00:03:17.770 --> 00:03:22.690
I can protect her while I'm alive, but after that...

00:03:23.930 --> 00:03:27.650
...That's why I'm having her play this game. That's the reason.

00:03:28.690 --> 00:03:32.270
To have someone protect Kajika, even risking his life.

00:03:32.850 --> 00:03:35.010
That's the only person she can have as her husband.

00:03:35.710 --> 00:03:38.400
Dad, you're so dumb!

00:03:38.520 --> 00:03:41.800
It's not an ordinary reason.
 You have to let it go.

00:03:42.120 --> 00:03:44.830
But, now the game is over, right?

00:03:45.110 --> 00:03:49.310
- What? You haven't chosen anyone yet
- Well, Dad...

00:03:49.450 --> 00:03:53.040
...kept my destiny a secret.

00:03:53.640 --> 00:03:55.910
He told me, he'll tell me once I choose a husband.

00:03:56.640 --> 00:04:01.470
But, I already know now.
So the game is over.

00:04:02.830 --> 00:04:06.260
Hey, didn't you make a promise with Dad?

00:04:06.670 --> 00:04:08.980
You will be there until the game ends, right?

00:04:09.280 --> 00:04:13.450
Harry made a promise with the leader of the Huangs, Lee-Leng Huang.

00:04:14.050 --> 00:04:16.540
I am here because of my own will.

00:04:16.930 --> 00:04:21.460
Then the promise is void?
Can we be together for a while?

00:04:21.820 --> 00:04:25.480
Until Raginei has calmed down.
 I'll rest for 21 years worth of time.

00:04:26.110 --> 00:04:29.250
Hey, don't make excuses! 
 Just be happy for it!

00:04:32.160 --> 00:04:35.700
Your priority rests with the Huang family.

00:04:36.160 --> 00:04:38.850
You can't be considered a candidate at that point.

00:04:39.440 --> 00:04:42.130
You can't be Kajika's husband like that.

00:04:42.700 --> 00:04:45.310
I am considering leaving the Huangs.

00:04:45.730 --> 00:04:47.480
It's a step that I couldn't take.

00:04:48.400 --> 00:04:51.340
My loyalty to the family.

00:04:51.340 --> 00:04:55.200
But the truth is, I loved the Huang family.

00:04:56.010 --> 00:05:00.320
I was afraid to leave that blood that was in me.

00:05:00.880 --> 00:05:02.800
Now, I know it's just foolish.

00:05:03.530 --> 00:05:07.800
Even if I step down as the leader of the Huangs, the blood of the Huangs will never leave me.

00:05:08.570 --> 00:05:12.070
Even if I'm not able to go to my home country or if people slander me.

00:05:14.030 --> 00:05:15.590
Lee-Leng?

00:05:17.450 --> 00:05:18.730
I'm alright.

00:05:20.650 --> 00:05:22.830
- Your face is different.
- Face?

00:05:24.470 --> 00:05:27.300
It's an expression that I've never seen from you.

00:05:28.460 --> 00:05:31.590
But it's good. Nice and gentle.

00:05:33.570 --> 00:05:35.640
- Denied entry, huh?
 - Yes, sir

00:05:36.140 --> 00:05:39.910
There was approval at one point but, we just got the message that it was denied.

00:05:40.590 --> 00:05:43.710
- I have no plans of changing my agenda. 
 - Your Highness Rumaty...

00:05:44.130 --> 00:05:46.620
...even if you go there you'll be rejected at the gates.

00:05:47.110 --> 00:05:50.080
I will land at the airport, that'll be enough.

00:05:50.970 --> 00:05:53.160
They can't turn royalty away.

00:05:53.660 --> 00:05:56.110
Even if they were ordered from above. 
 They will hesitate.

00:05:56.590 --> 00:06:01.550
- But, there's a fear of assassination!
- That's why I'll take the media with me.

00:06:02.200 --> 00:06:05.190
Raginei does not have the courage to have the world against itself.

00:06:07.540 --> 00:06:09.180
Then, I will continue with the process.

00:06:11.300 --> 00:06:15.120
<i>Quinza, you're the one that denied access into the country, huh?</i>

00:06:16.030 --> 00:06:20.610
<i>But, I will go. I am the only one that can stop you.</i>

00:06:21.780 --> 00:06:26.230
<i>Many lives were taken. 
Many of them innocent. </i>

00:06:27.000 --> 00:06:31.550
<i>Don't you think that it should be paid for with our lives now?</i>

00:06:32.340 --> 00:06:36.770
Master Quinza! The masses are getting close to the Palace! 
 Give us orders!

00:06:37.010 --> 00:06:40.350
The dissent may become greater in the morning!

00:06:40.710 --> 00:06:46.260
Captain Namka and the other chamberlains were among those who died in the helicopter accident!

00:06:46.360 --> 00:06:50.570
We are the only ones left! 
What are we to do?!

00:06:51.030 --> 00:06:54.030
Calm down. 
 Where did Master Sareha go?

00:06:54.230 --> 00:06:59.020
Master Sareha's in shock. 
 He said he can't even speak!

00:06:59.450 --> 00:07:03.030
- I'm at a loss of words.
- Master Quinza!

00:07:03.370 --> 00:07:07.700
Minister of Defense?! Army General Rezat?! What brings you here?

00:07:08.490 --> 00:07:11.910
Please take back the command of activating the military.

00:07:12.070 --> 00:07:14.480
May I see the King?! Please!

00:07:14.900 --> 00:07:18.600
Please rethink about pointing guns at our citizens!

00:07:19.310 --> 00:07:22.610
How leisurely of you, General.

00:07:22.830 --> 00:07:28.070
This is already a revolution.
 We've had the armored guards in front of the place since this morning.

00:07:28.460 --> 00:07:32.040
- This is the command of the King.
- To use the tanks?!

00:07:32.420 --> 00:07:36.570
Also, arrest these men by tonight.

00:07:37.720 --> 00:07:41.970
These people?! 
 Secretary of State and cabinet officials?!

00:07:42.350 --> 00:07:45.930
That is what Lieutenant Noei confessed to.

00:07:46.010 --> 00:07:50.420
But, the Secretary of State is His Highness Izmal's relative!

00:07:51.090 --> 00:07:55.040
Without a doubt, I would also have to ask Master Izmal of the situation.

00:07:55.400 --> 00:07:57.610
Traitors are everywhere.

00:07:58.320 --> 00:08:03.370
Noei is a good example. He escaped with the help of the chamberlains and the King's Army.

00:08:04.030 --> 00:08:07.770
The secret police is cleaning out the palace now.

00:08:08.410 --> 00:08:11.620
Make sure both of you watch what you say and do.

00:08:12.840 --> 00:08:14.250
Now, excuse me.

00:08:18.760 --> 00:08:22.710
- This has become a witch hunt! 
- General, please be calm.

00:08:23.460 --> 00:08:27.100
- Everything is because of the King now! 
 - General!

00:08:27.350 --> 00:08:31.820
- Did you hear that His Highness Rumaty has returned?! 
 - What?!

00:08:32.230 --> 00:08:37.230
- Why would he do such a dangerous thing?!
- I'm going to greet him with my subordinates!

00:08:37.680 --> 00:08:41.520
-  I have to protect him even with my life! 
 - You're right!

00:08:41.720 --> 00:08:44.130
Please let me know if I can help in any way!

00:08:45.950 --> 00:08:49.520
Is that right? 
 Minister of Defense and the General, huh?

00:08:50.390 --> 00:08:53.900
What should I do? 
 Immediately arrest them?

00:08:54.880 --> 00:08:58.620
- No, let them do their thing for a little.
- Yes, sir.

00:09:01.620 --> 00:09:07.390
The wind is beginning to blow--- a wind to welcome His Highness Rumaty.

00:09:07.860 --> 00:09:11.130
Quinza, I have something to talk to you about.

00:09:11.810 --> 00:09:14.950
Master Najayra, you've come home.

00:09:16.020 --> 00:09:19.080
You blew the helicopter up, didn't you?!

00:09:20.000 --> 00:09:23.350
- What are you saying? 
- Don't get near me!

00:09:24.020 --> 00:09:29.620
I heard from your servant Ioe. 
 I acted as if I knew!

00:09:30.340 --> 00:09:34.880
I was starting to suspect it. 
 I began straying from the voice of God.

00:09:34.980 --> 00:09:37.440
Then I started to question the things you were doing!

00:09:38.420 --> 00:09:43.320
How ironic, that I began seeing these things after I strayed from being a priestess.

00:09:44.580 --> 00:09:49.370
Ioe said to me. 
 "Let us wait hopefully until His Highness Rumaty returns."

00:09:51.010 --> 00:09:54.370
You traitor! 
 You were planning that from the beginning!

00:09:54.950 --> 00:09:58.470
To oust Somand and I, to welcome Rumaty as king!

00:09:58.860 --> 00:10:01.440
Why would you doubt Quinza?

00:10:02.000 --> 00:10:07.240
- I've pledged my wholehearted allegiance to you.
- That...

00:10:08.030 --> 00:10:12.600
...that's because you will do whatever! 
 Even killing political opponents...

00:10:13.030 --> 00:10:16.390
Master Najayra, you were doing the same thing too.

00:10:16.730 --> 00:10:21.430
- You would leave those you didn't like.
- I wouldn't do such a thing!

00:10:21.730 --> 00:10:26.710
The people that I disliked passed away, but they weren't meant to live long anyway!

00:10:27.050 --> 00:10:31.480
- All I did was give a prophecy. 
- That's a prophecy of a "Holy Girl."

00:10:32.120 --> 00:10:35.880
- To a fanatic believer it sounded like an order. 
- What?

00:10:36.730 --> 00:10:41.100
It will be carried out as prophesied.
 Exactly as the prophecy.

00:10:41.330 --> 00:10:45.610
- <i>What is he saying?</i> 
- Oh, that's right...

00:10:45.930 --> 00:10:50.560
-...you didn't notice that was going to happen and prophesied.
- <i>I'm scared!</i>

00:10:50.910 --> 00:10:54.480
But don't worry.
 I'll let you become the Queen.

00:10:54.860 --> 00:10:57.870
You will never be bored.

00:10:58.300 --> 00:11:01.400
<i>I am afraid of this man!</i>

00:11:05.590 --> 00:11:10.210
<i>It's my first time, being scared of a man, anyone.</i>

00:11:12.170 --> 00:11:17.480
<i>But, I am trying to believe in him. 
 I know it's a wholehearted lie.</i>

00:11:18.160 --> 00:11:20.870
<i>I am afraid! 
 My feelings are...</i>

00:11:22.180 --> 00:11:25.680
<i>...I'm in love with that devil!</i>

00:11:26.410 --> 00:11:31.390
<i>Now that I know the truth about him, I'm more attracted to him!</i>

00:11:32.810 --> 00:11:36.780
Hanasakeru Seishonen

00:11:48.080 --> 00:11:49.540
It is for a fact.

00:11:50.390 --> 00:11:54.520
- Rumaty's has put his life on the line, huh? 
 - What time is he arriving?

00:11:55.180 --> 00:11:57.170
Rumaty's coming to Raginei?!

00:11:57.720 --> 00:12:00.610
Master Kajika, you're awake?!

00:12:01.850 --> 00:12:06.570
His entry has been denied, but they can't shoot the plane down.

00:12:06.940 --> 00:12:11.170
- They're trying to cause a scene once they land.
- A scene?!

00:12:11.430 --> 00:12:15.910
There are going to be many that want the royalty to step down.

00:12:16.410 --> 00:12:22.090
If Rumaty, goes in the midst of that. Not only that, his life is wanted by the palace!

00:12:22.540 --> 00:12:26.600
The core members that were trying to assassinate him are gone from that helicopter accident.

00:12:26.970 --> 00:12:30.210
And the dissent of the people are aimed at the current King.

00:12:30.790 --> 00:12:36.090
According to Captain Kopel, there are people within the military that won't follow the orders from above.

00:12:36.410 --> 00:12:40.620
- That is definite.
- If His Highness Rumaty was to be hurt...

00:12:41.050 --> 00:12:45.800
...a riot may occur. 
 They won't be able to get to him easily.

00:12:46.370 --> 00:12:50.030
Is that so. 
 I'm going to the American Embassy then.

00:12:50.370 --> 00:12:54.580
If I go there I'll be able to gather information from abroad.

00:12:54.800 --> 00:12:57.400
No, let's have Toranosuke do that.

00:12:58.110 --> 00:13:01.980
- If I speak directly with Jim.
- No, I will go.

00:13:03.190 --> 00:13:07.300
- Let me go to the airport then! 
- No way! - You stay here!

00:13:11.540 --> 00:13:15.680
Isabelle? Why did you come all the way to Raginei? 
 What's going on?

00:13:16.410 --> 00:13:19.090
I came here to get my father.

00:13:19.090 --> 00:13:21.990
As I've told you, until he's recovered a little more...

00:13:22.370 --> 00:13:27.690
I want him to pass away in Texas! 
 His beloved state of Texas!

00:13:28.290 --> 00:13:30.490
Those things don't even cross your mind, do they!

00:13:31.230 --> 00:13:33.260
You hate my father!

00:13:33.770 --> 00:13:39.000
- But he was only hopeful in you! 
- He didn't love me as a son!

00:13:39.190 --> 00:13:41.670
What he needed was a capable successor!

00:13:42.120 --> 00:13:45.970
What about that! 
 He put the company first!

00:13:46.260 --> 00:13:50.240
He was leaving that all to you! 
 What else other than "love" is that?!

00:13:50.750 --> 00:13:56.230
I was jealous of you. 
 He loved you but you acted as though you were the only unfortunate one!

00:13:56.610 --> 00:14:01.170
I swore to myself, that I'll never tell him that you fell in the well.

00:14:02.220 --> 00:14:07.250
But, I heard him arguing with your mother.

00:14:07.670 --> 00:14:09.550
He thought she kidnapped you.

00:14:10.340 --> 00:14:12.890
I will never give Carl over to you!

00:14:13.150 --> 00:14:16.900
That's my successor! 
 I won't give him over, even if I have to kill you!

00:14:17.380 --> 00:14:19.360
I've never seen him like that.

00:14:19.830 --> 00:14:22.830
I was bitter from the bottom of my heart towards you.

00:14:23.560 --> 00:14:25.760
But, I told him where you were for my father.

00:14:26.490 --> 00:14:28.630
That's why you're alive!

00:14:29.800 --> 00:14:34.900
How regrettable! 
 If I were you, if I was loved like you!

00:14:35.320 --> 00:14:40.280
But, you won't even shed a tear even if he is on the verge of death!

00:14:42.710 --> 00:14:44.840
Sorry to interrupt, Master Carl.

00:14:45.320 --> 00:14:49.590
- The director won't be able to make it under the current conditions. 
- Is that so.

00:14:50.290 --> 00:14:54.430
- We must do something before the air force takes over the airport. 
-<i> My father fell because you betrayed him!</i>

00:14:55.540 --> 00:14:57.360
<i>I've lost all hope in you!</i>

00:14:59.050 --> 00:15:00.540
<i>You don't know.</i>

00:15:01.150 --> 00:15:04.020
<i>That I was in charge of investigating Burnsworth.</i>

00:15:04.240 --> 00:15:07.930
<i>So, I know.
 I know Burnsworth's relationship to Raginei.</i>

00:15:08.830 --> 00:15:12.940
<i>My father was saying he will reveal the secret, but he fell ill.</i>

00:15:13.540 --> 00:15:17.330
<i>Carl, you squashed that investigation didn't you?!</i>

00:15:17.780 --> 00:15:19.270
<i>For that little girl!</i>

00:15:20.130 --> 00:15:22.240
<i>I sent out a letter.</i>

00:15:22.590 --> 00:15:25.800
It was sent to Palace of Raginei, to Quinza Hafez.

00:15:26.980 --> 00:15:32.500
<i>What would he do if he learns who Kajika Burnsworth's grandfather is?!</i>

00:15:33.960 --> 00:15:36.380
<i>Carl this is revenge.</i>

00:15:36.950 --> 00:15:40.650
<i>Weep with the corpse of that girl in your arms!</i>

00:15:42.530 --> 00:15:45.810
Najayra! 
Where are you Najayra!

00:15:46.250 --> 00:15:50.240
Your Highness Izmal, what are you doing up this early?!

00:15:51.350 --> 00:15:56.670
Uncle, don't you know? 
 The Secretary of State has been labeled a rebel, and has been arrested!

00:15:57.020 --> 00:16:02.660
- What did you say?! 
- I can only think of this as a warning to me! I'm next!

00:16:02.850 --> 00:16:05.340
- What should I do?! 
- Calm down.

00:16:06.230 --> 00:16:09.000
There's no danger upon you right now.

00:16:09.350 --> 00:16:12.500
Najayra, is that the voice of God?

00:16:14.540 --> 00:16:16.900
I'm no longer a priestess.

00:16:17.440 --> 00:16:19.700
I can't hear the voice of God.

00:16:20.560 --> 00:16:24.770
There's no place for you in this government. 
 You're an outsider.

00:16:25.180 --> 00:16:27.310
That's why you're safe.

00:16:28.780 --> 00:16:31.170
Anyway, what are you going to do, Father?

00:16:31.650 --> 00:16:34.350
Rumaty will return in a few hours.

00:16:35.280 --> 00:16:38.400
There's no benefit of the siblings fighting against one another.

00:16:38.910 --> 00:16:41.870
I plan to mediate the reconciliation of the two.

00:16:42.480 --> 00:16:46.050
But, now that you and King Somand have been engaged...

00:16:46.330 --> 00:16:49.610
...if you ask me which side I will take, there's only one answer.

00:16:50.060 --> 00:16:52.130
Father, you have quite the task.

00:16:53.280 --> 00:16:55.380
<i>To have such a naive daughter.</i>

00:16:56.750 --> 00:17:01.400
<i>The King that I'm engaged to is a nobody.</i>

00:17:02.830 --> 00:17:06.530
<i>But, this issue will soon come to a conclusion.</i>

00:17:07.930 --> 00:17:10.860
The chamberlains have gone into a panic.

00:17:11.530 --> 00:17:15.220
They were talking among themselves to see what they are going to do next.

00:17:17.200 --> 00:17:21.660
I can see the outcome of this. 
 Everyone will side with His Highness Rumaty.

00:17:22.450 --> 00:17:26.600
Now, the only problem is that there is no definite villain.

00:17:27.040 --> 00:17:30.960
- Are you talking about Master Sareha? 
- He's useless now.

00:17:31.560 --> 00:17:35.450
Oh well. We can make villains up if we want to.

00:17:36.120 --> 00:17:39.080
Anyway, it is important to welcome His Highness.

00:17:39.620 --> 00:17:42.040
Give the special police strict orders...

00:17:42.520 --> 00:17:45.100
...to not lay a finger on His Highness.

00:17:45.640 --> 00:17:49.080
Don't worry, the rebel faction has dissipated.

00:17:49.240 --> 00:17:54.440
It has been acting as the villain for two years.  This day has come quicker than I thought.

00:17:55.010 --> 00:17:59.180
I trust that His Highness Rumaty will lead this country in the right direction.

00:18:00.140 --> 00:18:03.130
- I am satisfied. 
- Master Quinza.

00:18:03.480 --> 00:18:09.440
His Highness will acknowledge you.
 That you've done everything for His Highness.

00:18:10.010 --> 00:18:12.820
<i>That's right, His Highness knows.</i>

00:18:13.360 --> 00:18:18.930
<i>That I was the one leading this country into panic controlling the King and Sareha.</i>

00:18:20.970 --> 00:18:22.750
<i>His Highness will not forgive me.</i>

00:18:23.360 --> 00:18:27.150
<i>But, a challenge will arise as soon as he his crowned.</i>

00:18:28.040 --> 00:18:32.790
<i>To aid him in that, I must also deceive even His Highness!</i>

00:18:33.810 --> 00:18:34.860
Excuse me.

00:18:36.170 --> 00:18:40.150
- Master Quinza. I've received a letter for you.
- A letter?

00:18:42.540 --> 00:18:45.720
Isabelle Rosenthal? Carl's sister?

00:18:48.270 --> 00:18:50.690
Master Quinza, what's wrong?

00:18:55.090 --> 00:18:57.000
I really have to stay here?

00:18:57.440 --> 00:19:01.490
We don't have a choice! 
Noei's subordinates are here and it's safe.

00:19:02.290 --> 00:19:05.880
Toranosuke will be back from the embassy shorty. 
 Just stay put.

00:19:06.430 --> 00:19:10.570
The airport is going to be in chaos. 
 There's no assurance that the military won't move in.

00:19:11.240 --> 00:19:14.230
I don't even know if we can meet up with Noei.

00:19:14.710 --> 00:19:15.890
I'll...

00:19:17.480 --> 00:19:21.880
We'll even have a hard time defending ourselves if something happens, you know?

00:19:23.950 --> 00:19:26.460
Will Zao come with Rumaty?

00:19:26.620 --> 00:19:29.810
Probably, I don't know if I have time to talk to him.

00:19:31.020 --> 00:19:34.520
Don't worry, I'll make my retirement clear.

00:19:42.930 --> 00:19:45.730
Are you really going to step down as the director of the Huangs?

00:19:47.710 --> 00:19:49.910
What are you going to do from here on out?

00:19:50.480 --> 00:19:53.280
I have enough saved to live alone.

00:19:53.980 --> 00:19:59.150
Anyway, I wasn't expecting to be lectured about my future from you.

00:19:59.940 --> 00:20:01.950
A born aristocrat like you.

00:20:02.550 --> 00:20:04.690
Right, I'm an aristocrat.

00:20:04.910 --> 00:20:07.970
It's a virtue of a gentleman to play all day without working.

00:20:08.450 --> 00:20:10.090
But, you're different.

00:20:10.800 --> 00:20:15.210
- You see working and making money as a virtue. 
- That's a misunderstanding.

00:20:15.740 --> 00:20:20.490
I was only born into that. 
 To tell you the truth, it was too heavy for me.

00:20:21.730 --> 00:20:24.250
I'm very clumsy.

00:20:24.790 --> 00:20:27.690
To protect the Huangs and protect Kajika...

00:20:28.160 --> 00:20:32.340
...I wasn't able to do both.

00:20:33.100 --> 00:20:35.400
To love someone without hesitating.

00:20:36.030 --> 00:20:39.850
It took me 21 years to be able to come to that point.

00:20:40.560 --> 00:20:43.140
I get it.
 You are very clumsy.

00:20:43.770 --> 00:20:46.350
To tell you the truth, I really don't like you.

00:20:46.800 --> 00:20:48.680
That's the same for me too.

00:20:49.410 --> 00:20:51.610
At least we agree on something.

00:20:56.740 --> 00:21:01.040
It's Toranosuke. 
I was able to get in contact with Master Carl.

00:21:01.290 --> 00:21:05.020
He wants to talk with Master Lee-Leng regarding Master Kajika.

00:21:05.590 --> 00:21:07.790
Carl wants to talk to me about Kajika?

00:21:08.460 --> 00:21:11.650
Yes, sir. 
 Mr. Nelson is in the hospital.

00:21:11.800 --> 00:21:15.560
He wants you to come to that hospital immediately.

00:21:16.260 --> 00:21:19.290
Hospital? 
 I got it. I'm headed there.

00:21:19.480 --> 00:21:21.770
I'll investigate more and return to the hideout.

00:21:22.830 --> 00:21:25.570
I'm worried about Kajika. 
Take care of her.

00:21:26.870 --> 00:21:30.760
- I'm going to take a detour.
- Rumaty is going to arrive in an hour.

00:21:31.590 --> 00:21:34.870
Take this car and go ahead.
 I'll follow immediately.

00:21:41.050 --> 00:21:44.650
<i>I apologize for sending you these documents all of a sudden.</i>

00:21:45.160 --> 00:21:48.720
But, please take a look at the investigation sheet.

00:21:49.900 --> 00:21:56.150
This is what my father compiled over the last few decades about Burnsworth.

00:21:57.100 --> 00:22:00.130
According to this, Harry Burnsworth is...

00:22:00.510 --> 00:22:03.540
...His Majesty Machaty's Throne of God's illegitimate child.

00:22:03.850 --> 00:22:06.590
That is the truth that you get.

00:22:07.140 --> 00:22:10.580
Therefore, the first in line to succeed the throne is...

00:22:10.770 --> 00:22:14.880
- ...Kajika Burnsworth. 
- <i>Nonsense!</i>

00:22:15.960 --> 00:22:19.530
<i>What kind of evidence is this investigation sheet?!</i>

00:22:20.420 --> 00:22:22.870
<i>However silly the rumor may be...</i>

00:22:22.870 --> 00:22:27.040
<i>Wouldn't it be a critical blow to a newly crowned king?!</i>

00:22:28.540 --> 00:22:31.790
<i>If the rebel faction will rally behind her...</i>

00:22:32.170 --> 00:22:34.850
<i>...No! Even if she's not willing to...</i>

00:22:35.520 --> 00:22:39.910
<i>If she bears a child, that child would become the rightful successor to the throne!</i>

00:22:42.490 --> 00:22:44.250
<i>Kajika Burnsworth!</i>

00:22:45.930 --> 00:22:48.320
<i>A thorn in the heart of the royal family.</i>

00:22:51.250 --> 00:22:53.670
<i>You will forever threaten the royalty!</i>

00:22:55.300 --> 00:22:57.340
<i>Unless you are brought to an end right now!</i>

00:23:01.670 --> 00:23:08.380
I can't stand feeling this distance,

00:23:09.150 --> 00:23:16.210
So I'm starting to search for your heart.

00:23:16.700 --> 00:23:22.790
Because you were always at my side, protecting me.

00:23:23.450 --> 00:23:28.020
And I'm afraid of being alone.

00:23:30.240 --> 00:23:37.280
Though it's been a long time, everyone's just the same.

00:23:37.560 --> 00:23:44.720
Whether sleeping now, or crying, I want to see your smiling face.

00:23:44.720 --> 00:23:52.240
Because I will love you, with heart overflowing.

00:23:52.240 --> 00:23:59.330
Don't turn away, look at me. I believe in you.

00:23:59.910 --> 00:24:06.860
So, no one else knows our secret thoughts

00:24:07.250 --> 00:24:14.240
The blue sea of a strong and beautiful time.

00:24:14.590 --> 00:24:23.730
In those arms, in that embrace, I'm alive.
